        </p>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500\">\n                Ideal for press briefings & intimate talks\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Step 2 */}\n            <div className=\"bg-zinc-900 border border-[#E50914] p-6 rounded relative flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg\">\n              <div className=\"absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#E50914] text-white text-[9px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest rounded\">\n                CORE WORKFLOW\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#E50914] font-bold\">STAGE 02</span>\n                <h3 className=\"text-lg font-display font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2\">\n                  MULTI-CAMERA\n                </h3>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-zinc-300\">\n                  3\342\200\2234 Cinema cameras, live vision switcher, audio engineer, and branded lower-third graphics.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400 font-bold\">\n                Ideal for conferences & church services\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Step 3 */}\n            <div className=\"bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 p-6 rounded relative flex flex-col justify-between\">\n              <div>\n                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#E50914] font-bold\">STAGE 03</span>\n                <h3 className=\"text-lg font-display font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2\">\n                  FULL BROADCAST\n                </h3>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">\n                  6+ Cameras, OB flypack racks, full crew, LED wall integration, satellite/5G bonding, and ProRes ISO archives.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n      