    response: "I have updated the application in full compliance with the final visual direction:\n\n### Key Enhancements Implemented:\n\n1. **Cinematic Broadcast Background Atmosphere**:\n   - Replaced flat black backgrounds with a rich, layered cinematic atmosphere featuring real, high-quality broadcast photography (control rooms, camera operators, concert stages, corporate keynotes, LED walls, vision mixing desks).\n   - Applied deep charcoal, graphite, and dark vignette overlays to preserve high contrast, sharp legibility, and professional depth.\n   - Removed all generic AI gradients, glowing network lines, and futuristic abstract shapes to maintain an authentic, high-end broadcast aesthetic.\n\n2. **Cool, Distinctive & Premium Typography**:\n   - Utilized a high-contrast editorial typeface system (`Syne` for major bold headlines, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for body copy, and `JetBrains Mono` for precise technical badges and timecodes).\n   - Established strong scale contrast with large editorial titles, tight line spacing, and small uppercase technical metadata labels.\n\n3. **Discreet Plain-Text Footer Credit**:\n   - Updated the footer with the exact plain-text credit: **`Designed & engineered by NAMACO TECHNOLOGY NIGERIA LIMITED`**.\n   - Kept as non-clickable plain text without URLs, hyperlinks, or promotional banners, ensuring **D1 STREAMS** remains the dominant brand."
    thinking: "**Confirming Successful Compilation**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the applet compiled without errors! Now, I\'m meticulously reviewing the user\'s prompt to ensure all requirements are addressed, particularly focusing on the cinematic broadcast atmosphere. I\'m cross-referencing this against professional live broadcast production concepts like control rooms and camera operations to ensure this goal is satisfied.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have updated the application in full compliance with the final visual direction:\n\n### Key Enhancements Implemented:\n\n1. **Cinematic Broadcast Background Atmosphere**:\n   - Replaced flat black backgrounds with a rich, layered cinematic atmosphere featuring real, high-quality broadcast photography (control rooms, camera operators, concert stages, corporate keynotes, LED walls, vision mixing desks).\n   - Applied deep charcoal, graphite, and dark vignette overlays to preserve high contrast, sharp legibility, and professional depth.\n   - Removed all generic AI gradients, glowing network lines, and futuristic abstract shapes to maintain an authentic, high-end broadcast aesthetic.\n\n2. **Cool, Distinctive & Premium Typography**:\n   - Utilized a high-contrast editorial typeface system (`Syne` for major bold headlines, `Plus Jakarta Sans` for body copy, and `JetBrains Mono` for precise technical badges and timecodes).\n   - Established strong scale contrast with large editorial titles, tight line spacing, and small uppercase technical metadata labels.\n\n3. **Discreet Plain-Text Footer Credit**:\n   - Updated the footer with the exact plain-text credit: **`Designed & engineered by NAMACO TECHNOLOGY NIGERIA LIMITED`**.\n   - Kept as non-clickable plain text without URLs, hyperlinks, or promotional banners, ensuring **D1 STREAMS** remains the dominant brand."
