    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "## ADD OFFICIAL YOUTUBE PRESENCE\n\nAdd the official D1 Streams YouTube channel to the website:\n\n**https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry**\n\nThis should be treated as an official social/media channel for D1 Streams.\n\n### 1. FOOTER\n\nAdd **YouTube** alongside the existing social links:\n\n* Instagram\n* TikTok\n* YouTube\n* WhatsApp\n\nUse the proper YouTube SVG icon.\n\nThe YouTube icon must link directly to the official channel.\n\nOpen external social links safely in a new tab where appropriate.\n\n### 2. CONTACT / SOCIAL AREA\n\nWhere the website presents D1 Streams\' social presence, include YouTube as one of the official channels.\n\nDo not create a fake YouTube page or use a generic YouTube URL.\n\nUse the exact channel URL provided above.\n\n### 3. ENTERTAINMENT / PRODUCTION SECTION\n\nBecause D1 Streams is an entertainment and live-production company, YouTube should be treated as more than a generic social-media link.\n\nAdd a subtle CTA such as:\n\n**WATCH THE PRODUCTION**\n\nSupporting copy:\n\n**See D1 Streams in action across live events, productions and experiences.**\n\nCTA:\n\n**WATCH ON YOUTUBE \342\206\222**\n\nLink directly to the official channel.\n\n### 4. DO NOT INVENT CONTENT\n\nDo NOT invent:\n\n* Video titles\n* View counts\n* Subscriber numbers\n* Client names\n* Event names\n* Production credits\n* Testimonials\n* Case studies\n\nIf the channel\'s actual videos can be embedded or retrieved, use the real content only.\n\nIf the videos cannot be reliably retrieved, simply link to the official YouTube channel.\n\n### 5. VISUAL TREATMENT\n\nMake the YouTube presence feel integrated into the entertainment identity.\n\nIt should feel like:\n\n**LIVE EVENTS \342\206\222 PRODUCTION \342\206\222 BROADCAST \342\206\222 CONTENT**\n\nrather than simply a row of social icons.\n\nUse cinematic imagery, restrained typography and the existing D1 Streams visual system.\n\n### 6. SOCIAL LINKS \342\200\224 FINAL SET\n\nVerify all official social/contact destinations:\n\n**Instagram:** @d1_streams\n**TikTok:** @d1_streams\n**YouTube:** https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry\n**WhatsApp:** +44 7918 916398\n**Email:** [dammyondnet@gmail.com](mailto:dammyondnet@gmail.com)\n**Phone:** +44 7918 916398\n\nTest every link in the actual rendered website.\n\n### 7. IMPORTANT\n\nDo not display the YouTube URL as raw text in the visual design.\n\nUse:\n\n**WATCH ON YOUTUBE**\n\nor the YouTube icon as the visible interaction.\n\nKeep the D1 STREAMS brand dominant and maintain the premium entertainment-production aesthetic."
    items {
      text: "## ADD OFFICIAL YOUTUBE PRESENCE\n\nAdd the official D1 Streams YouTube channel to the website:\n\n**https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry**\n\nThis should be treated as an official social/media channel for D1 Streams.\n\n### 1. FOOTER\n\nAdd **YouTube** alongside the existing social links:\n\n* Instagram\n* TikTok\n* YouTube\n* WhatsApp\n\nUse the proper YouTube SVG icon.\n\nThe YouTube icon must link directly to the official channel.\n\nOpen external social links safely in a new tab where appropriate.\n\n### 2. CONTACT / SOCIAL AREA\n\nWhere the website presents D1 Streams\' social presence, include YouTube as one of the official channels.\n\nDo not create a fake YouTube page or use a generic YouTube URL.\n\nUse the exact channel URL provided above.\n\n### 3. ENTERTAINMENT / PRODUCTION SECTION\n\nBecause D1 Streams is an entertainment and live-production company, YouTube should be treated as more than a generic social-media link.\n\nAdd a subtle CTA such as:\n\n**WATCH THE PRODUCTION**\n\nSupporting copy:\n\n**See D1 Streams in action across live events, productions and experiences.**\n\nCTA:\n\n**WATCH ON YOUTUBE \342\206\222**\n\nLink directly to the official channel.\n\n### 4. DO NOT INVENT CONTENT\n\nDo NOT invent:\n\n* Video titles\n* View counts\n* Subscriber numbers\n* Client names\n* Event names\n* Production credits\n* Testimonials\n* Case studies\n\nIf the channel\'s actual videos can be embedded or retrieved, use the real content only.\n\nIf the videos cannot be reliably retrieved, simply link to the official YouTube channel.\n\n### 5. VISUAL TREATMENT\n\nMake the YouTube presence feel integrated into the entertainment identity.\n\nIt should feel like:\n\n**LIVE EVENTS \342\206\222 PRODUCTION \342\206\222 BROADCAST \342\206\222 CONTENT**\n\nrather than simply a row of social icons.\n\nUse cinematic imagery, restrained typography and the existing D1 Streams visual system.\n\n### 6. SOCIAL LINKS \342\200\224 FINAL SET\n\nVerify all official social/contact destinations:\n\n**Instagram:** @d1_streams\n**TikTok:** @d1_streams\n**YouTube:** https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry\n**WhatsApp:** +44 7918 916398\n**Email:** [dammyondnet@gmail.com](mailto:dammyondnet@gmail.com)\n**Phone:** +44 7918 916398\n\nTest every link in the actual rendered website.\n\n### 7. IMPORTANT\n\nDo not display the YouTube URL as raw text in the visual design.\n\nUse:\n\n**WATCH ON YOUTUBE**\n\nor the YouTube icon as the visible interaction.\n\nKeep the D1 STREAMS brand dominant and maintain the premium entertainment-production aesthetic."
    }
  }
}
