    modified_response: "I have integrated the official **D1 Streams YouTube Channel** and verified all social and contact destinations across the platform:\n\n- **Official Broadcast & Media Section (`YouTubeShowcase.tsx`)**:\n  - Implemented an entertainment production media section featuring the visual workflow sequence: **`LIVE EVENTS \342\206\222 PRODUCTION \342\206\222 BROADCAST \342\206\222 CONTENT`**.\n  - Includes the eyebrow badge **WATCH THE PRODUCTION**, the headline **\"SEE D1 STREAMS IN ACTION ACROSS LIVE EVENTS, PRODUCTIONS AND EXPERIENCES.\"**, and a primary **WATCH ON YOUTUBE \342\206\222** button linking directly to `https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry`.\n- **Footer & Mobile Navigation Integration**:\n  - Added YouTube alongside Instagram (`@d1_streams`), TikTok (`@d1_streams`), and WhatsApp (`+44 7918 916398`).\n  - Rendered using the official YouTube vector icon with safe `target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"` attributes.\n- **Production Enquiry Section**:\n  - Added a direct **Watch on YouTube** quick button alongside Email, Phone, and WhatsApp.\n- **Verified Official Channels**:\n  - **Instagram:** `@d1_streams` (`https://instagram.com/d1_streams`)\n  - **TikTok:** `@d1_streams` (`https://tiktok.com/@d1_streams`)\n  - **YouTube:** `https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry`\n  - **WhatsApp:** `+44 7918 916398` (`https://wa.me/447918916398`)\n  - **Email:** `dammyondnet@gmail.com` (`mailto:dammyondnet@gmail.com`)\n  - **Phone:** `+44 7918 916398` (`tel:+447918916398`)"
