  planner_response {
    response: "I have conducted a final visual quality control and design pass on the **D1 Streams** web platform:\n\n### 1. Visual Energy & Production Photography\n- **Cinematic Atmosphere**: Embedded high-resolution broadcast imagery across live concert stages, multi-camera vision-mixer control rooms, camera rigs, and arena audiences.\n- **Warm Editorial Light Palette**: Crafted light sections (**Introduction**, **Production Process**, **Production Specifications**, and **Recent Production Work**) with a warm stone canvas (`#F5F4F0`, `#ECEBE6`, `#F4F3EE`, `#F2F1EC`), deep graphite text (`#111216`), and fine dark borders to give them an editorial layout rather than a generic corporate look.\n\n### 2. High-Impact Image Scale & Art Direction\n- **Full-Width Hero & Control Room Visuals**: Expanded background visual feeds and multi-camera switcher layouts in the **Hero** and **Production in Action** sections.\n- **Clean Light/Dark Cadence**: Established an intentional sequence where **dark sections** deliver broadcast drama (`Hero` \342\206\222 `Capabilities` \342\206\222 `Global` \342\206\222 `YouTube Showcase` \342\206\222 `In Action` \342\206\222 `Enquiry Desk`), while **light sections** present technical specs, process, and editorial credibility.\n\n### 3. Hero & YouTube Integration\n- **Hero Staging**: Anchored by the primary statement: **D1 STREAMS \342\200\224 LIVE EVENTS. BUILT FOR BROADCAST.** backed by interactive multi-camera switcher controls (`CAM 1` through `CAM 4`).\n- **Official YouTube Presence**: Integrated the channel (`https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry`) as a core media asset with the workflow banner **`LIVE EVENTS \342\206\222 PRODUCTION \342\206\222 BROADCAST \342\206\222 CONTENT`**, the callout **`WATCH THE PRODUCTION`**, and direct CTA buttons **`WATCH ON YOUTUBE \342\206\222`**.\n\n### 4. Verified Contact Experience & Social Links\n- **Email**: `mailto:dammyondnet@gmail.com`\n- **Phone**: `tel:+447918916398`\n- **WhatsApp Direct**: `https://wa.me/447918916398`\n- **Instagram**: `https://instagram.com/d1_streams` (`@d1_streams`)\n- **TikTok**: `https://tiktok.com/@d1_streams` (`@d1_streams`)\n- **YouTube**: `https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry`\n- **Interactive Production Enquiry Desk**: Form with live state validation, budget range selectors, event type picks, and instant submission callbacks.\n\n### 5. Mobile & Responsive Refinement\n- Verified responsive layouts, ensuring full touch-target compliance ($\\ge 44\\text{px}$), proper text contrast ratios, and zero horizontal overflow across mobile devices."
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visual Energy**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the \"compile_applet\" build succeeded. Now, I\'m diving into the visual energy of the app, verifying the presence of live concerts, stage lighting, and multi-cam vision mixing across the specified sections. I am verifying this is across the app\'s visual representation.\n\n\n**Enhancing The Visuals**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the visual design elements, specifically image scaling. I\'m exploring the use of large, full-width cinematic images and integrating full-bleed vision-mixer photography and bold multi-camera feeds in the Hero and YouTubeShowcase sections. Furthermore, I\'m establishing a strong light/dark rhythm to guide the user\'s focus, with dark tones for high-impact sections and light tones for editorial content. I am focused on ensuring the overall design remains clean and uncluttered.\n\n\n**Refining Brand Identity**\n\nI\'m now integrating design principles: bold typography and restrained motion are key. I\'m avoiding visually cheap effects like gradients. The \"Hero\" section, with its live events focus, needs a strong impact. I\'ve also incorporated authentic production venues and integrated the YouTube presence, emphasizing real content and a call to action. I am also working on the contact and social media information.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have conducted a final visual quality control and design pass on the **D1 Streams** web platform:\n\n### 1. Visual Energy & Production Photography\n- **Cinematic Atmosphere**: Embedded high-resolution broadcast imagery across live concert stages, multi-camera vision-mixer control rooms, camera rigs, and arena audiences.\n- **Warm Editorial Light Palette**: Crafted light sections (**Introduction**, **Production Process**, **Production Specifications**, and **Recent Production Work**) with a warm stone canvas (`#F5F4F0`, `#ECEBE6`, `#F4F3EE`, `#F2F1EC`), deep graphite text (`#111216`), and fine dark borders to give them an editorial layout rather than a generic corporate look.\n\n### 2. High-Impact Image Scale & Art Direction\n- **Full-Width Hero & Control Room Visuals**: Expanded background visual feeds and multi-camera switcher layouts in the **Hero** and **Production in Action** sections.\n- **Clean Light/Dark Cadence**: Established an intentional sequence where **dark sections** deliver broadcast drama (`Hero` \342\206\222 `Capabilities` \342\206\222 `Global` \342\206\222 `YouTube Showcase` \342\206\222 `In Action` \342\206\222 `Enquiry Desk`), while **light sections** present technical specs, process, and editorial credibility.\n\n### 3. Hero & YouTube Integration\n- **Hero Staging**: Anchored by the primary statement: **D1 STREAMS \342\200\224 LIVE EVENTS. BUILT FOR BROADCAST.** backed by interactive multi-camera switcher controls (`CAM 1` through `CAM 4`).\n- **Official YouTube Presence**: Integrated the channel (`https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry`) as a core media asset with the workflow banner **`LIVE EVENTS \342\206\222 PRODUCTION \342\206\222 BROADCAST \342\206\222 CONTENT`**, the callout **`WATCH THE PRODUCTION`**, and direct CTA buttons **`WATCH ON YOUTUBE \342\206\222`**.\n\n### 4. Verified Contact Experience & Social Links\n- **Email**: `mailto:dammyondnet@gmail.com`\n- **Phone**: `tel:+447918916398`\n- **WhatsApp Direct**: `https://wa.me/447918916398`\n- **Instagram**: `https://instagram.com/d1_streams` (`@d1_streams`)\n- **TikTok**: `https://tiktok.com/@d1_streams` (`@d1_streams`)\n- **YouTube**: `https://youtube.com/@oluwadamilolaolayinka-fk2ry`\n- **Interactive Production Enquiry Desk**: Form with live state validation, budget range selectors, event type picks, and instant submission callbacks.\n\n### 5. Mobile & Responsive Refinement\n- Verified responsive layouts, ensuring full touch-target compliance ($\\ge 44\\text{px}$), proper text contrast ratios, and zero horizontal overflow across mobile devices."
